<title>USA: Bear, Stearns names a managing director.</title>
<headline>Bear, Stearns names a managing director.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear, Stearns &amp; Co Inc said Friday that Arthur Spector has joined the firm as managing director in public finance.</p>
<p>Spector will assist the firm in expanding its public finance efforts among major issuers, particularly in Florida, it said.</p>
<p>Most recently, Spector was managing director and manager of the public finance department at Prudential Securities.</p>
